---
import Component from "../../../src/components/donate/MomentumHero.astro";
import "../../../src/styles/tokens.css";

// Isolation page for a Hero video path that resolves to nothing — an editor
// typed a filename that was never committed, or the file was later removed.
//
// The assertion is that this is INDISTINGUISHABLE from the ordinary hero: the
// photo, the headline in place, no gap, no black band, no broken-media icon.
// That is structural rather than lucky. `heroImage` is still the section's CSS
// background and still the video's poster, so the element covering it simply has
// nothing to paint and the photo shows through. Nothing detects the failure and
// nothing recovers from it, which is why there is no JavaScript here and no
// state in which a visitor sees the page mid-repair.
//
// Rendered for a PUBLIC visitor — no `previewName`, so the headline is the
// generic one. That is who actually meets this state: the broken path affects
// everyone, while the personalized headline only reaches people arriving from
// the campaign email. It also keeps this capture distinct from
// MomentumHero-Video, which pins the personalized headline; two frames that
// differ only in a way no screenshot can show (one video plays, one 404s) would
// otherwise be identical images asserting different things.
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Isolated: MomentumHero - Video Missing</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="codeyam-capture">
      <Component
        headlineNamed="{name}, let's go further together"
        headlineGeneric="Let's go further together"
        subhead="Help sustain the Harvard Alumni in Tech community and the connections, opportunities, and support that move us forward."
        image="/images/bg/hero-bg.jpg"
        video="/videos/not-committed-yet.mp4"
        ctaLabel="Make a Gift"
        email="ben@harvardintech.com"
        campaignName="The Momentum Fund"
      />
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
